        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Starting in late 2025, we began marketing the MediTouch BalanceTutor to our Enterprise Health customers as a complimentary offering for treadmill-based gait training.",
